{
	'name': 'The SSB Queries (flat)',
	'intro': "This includes the 13 queries of the Star Schema Benchmark (O'Neil et al., revision 3, 2009) with the constants of the specification (Q2.3: brand 'MFGR#2239', as used by ClickHouse and Doris; the specification's text and SQL disagree there). The queries read the denormalized table lineorder_flat; year, month and week come from lo_orderdate.",
